060 Ti); **Qwen3.8-27B** trains in **~2GB** at seq 512.\n\n```bash\npip install -U airllm\npip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git\n```\n\nPoint `--data` at a JSONL file (`{\"text\": \"...\"}` or `{\"prompt\": \"...\", \"completion\": \"...\"}`):\n\n```bash\npython air_llm/examples/train_qwen38_flash_next_lora.py   --data my_data.jsonl   --seq-len 512   --epochs 1   --save-adapter qwen38-flash-next-lora.pt\n```\n\nFlash-Next still needs in-tree `qwen4_exp` (GitHub `transformers` main today).","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"AirLLM 70B inference with single 4GB GPU","url":"https://github.com/lyogavin/airllm","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49154228","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-03","points":232,"comments":84},{"title":"AirLLM: Inference 2.8T Kimi K3 on a single 4GB GPU","url":"https://github.com/lyogavin/airllm","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49142538","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-02","points":2,"comments":0},{"title":"AirLLM optimizes inference memory usage","url":"https://github.com/lyogavin/airllm","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47293735","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-03-08","points":2,"comments":0},{"title":"AirLLMで4GBのGPUに70Bモデルは動くのか、1トークンにかかる時間を試算した","url":"https://note.com/snake_dragon/n/nb4f1b7ebefeb","source":"note","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-28"},{"title":"为什么你的 AirLLM 比别人慢三倍？一个 4GB 老显卡玩家的调优踩坑全复盘","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_01114/article/details/168541349","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-20"},{"title":"刚刚冲上 GitHub 日榜第7：AirLLM 一天狂揽 541 星，三年老项目为何突然翻红？","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00634/article/details/168425887","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-19"},{"title":"这周 GitHub 上涨星最猛的 10 个 AI 开源项目","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UAn36aEX3/","source":"bilibili","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-17"},{"title":"AirLLM: Große KI-Modelle auf schwachen Grafik